{
  "name": "Sephirotic Scion (Seraphic): Cleansing Breath",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "art/bbttcc/GOTTGAIT/BBTTCC%20Button%20Icons/bbttcc_icons_shout_8.png",
  "system": {
    "category": "technique",
    "source": "Bad Eden Heritages v1.1 (RFI-native rules)",
    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-canon-sephirotic=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div><p><em>\"What couldn't stand the light was never going to last anyway.\"</em></p><p><strong>Cleansing Breath (1/Soma Break).</strong> Action — exhale a 3 squares cone of radiant fire. Each creature in the cone makes an Intrigue check vs. your Resolve. On a failure, take 2d10 exploding sephirotic damage (flavor: holy fire); half on a success.</p><p><strong>Tier scaling:</strong> 3d10 at Tier 2 · 4d10 at Tier 3 · 5d10 at Tier 4.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"sephSeraphicCleansingBreath\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\"><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #d4b8e8; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-size: 0.78rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Cleansing Breath</strong></span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.92; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 0.86rem\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break  ·  <strong>Action:</strong> Action (3 squares cone)  ·  <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.82rem\">Exhale radiant fire — each creature in the cone makes Intrigue check vs your Resolve. Failure: 2d10 exploding sephirotic (holy fire); success: half. Tier-scaled: T2 3d10, T3 4d10, T4 5d10.</span></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
